===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# An [[instruction]] or [[guideline]] that indicates how to [[perform]] an action or [[reach]] a [[goal]].
# {{lb|en|programming}} A [[construct]] in [[source code]] that indicates how it should be processed but is not necessarily part of the program to be run.
# An [[authoritative]] [[decision]] from an official [[body]], which may or may not have [[bind]]ing [[force]].
# {{lb|en|European Union law}} A form of [[legislative]] [[act]] addressed to the [[member state]]s. The directive binds the member state to reach certain objectives in their national legislation.
# The [[directive case]].

